  "title": {
    "rendered": "Container Offices for Sale in Ghaziabad"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "<p>For a container office in Ghaziabad, SAMAN Portable manufactures and supplies steel-framed container offices across Ghaziabad and the wider Delhi NCR — including Indirapuram, Vasundhara, Sahibabad, Mohan Nagar and Loni. Each unit is built at our factory and delivered ready to use, which suits schools, sales counters, security posts, site offices and any setup that needs working space quickly without permanent construction.</p>\n\n<h2>Container Offices for Sale in Ghaziabad</h2>\n<p>A container office is a factory-built steel cabin used as an office, classroom-support unit, sales point or security post — no foundation required. It arrives finished, is usable from day one, and can be moved when needs change. SAMAN supplies 10ft, 20ft and 40ft units on an MS steel frame, customised to your layout.</p>\n\n<h2>Container office sizes we supply</h2>\n<p>Three standard footprints, each customised internally.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr><th>Size</th><th>Typical use</th><th>Fit-out</th></tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>10ft</td><td>Security cabin, sales kiosk, single-desk office</td><td>Door, window, lighting, power points</td></tr>\n<tr><td>20ft</td><td>Site or school admin office, team office for 4–6</td><td>AC provision, partitions, storage, workstations</td></tr>\n<tr><td>40ft</td><td>Larger office or multi-room unit</td><td>Multiple rooms, washroom provision, networking</td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>All units are built on an MS steel frame to IS 2062, with insulated wall and roof panels for comfort through Ghaziabad's hot summers and cool winters. Stackable and relocatable layouts are available where access allows.</p>\n\n<h2>Why buy your container office direct from SAMAN</h2>\n<p>SAMAN POS India Private Limited is a manufacturer, not a marketplace or reseller. Buying direct keeps price, build quality and after-sales support with one company.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Factory-built quality:</strong> MS steel frame to IS 2062; ISO 9001:2015 certified.</li>\n<li><strong>Backed warranty:</strong> 5 years structural frame and base + 1–2 years finishing + 20–25 years engineered service life.</li>\n<li><strong>Clear logistics:</strong> delivery from ₹3,000, typical transit 3–5 days, returns within 7 days of delivery/installation.</li>\n<li><strong>Made to your use:</strong> office, sales, security or institutional layouts customised before dispatch.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Delivery and installation in Ghaziabad</h2>\n<p>We deliver finished container offices across Ghaziabad and the wider NCR from our North India manufacturing unit. Units arrive structurally complete, so installation on a prepared, level surface is quick and there is no extended on-site construction. The cabin can be repositioned later as your site or campus changes.</p>\n\n<h2>Get a container office quote in Ghaziabad</h2>\n<p>Tell us the size, layout and the Ghaziabad location, and we will send current pricing and a delivery estimate. Price depends on size, fit-out and distance, so we quote against your real requirement. <a href=\"https://www.samanportable.com/product-category/container-offices\">Explore our container office range</a> to start.</p>\n<p><strong>Call +91 62009 09435</strong> or use <strong>Send Enquiry</strong> for a quote to your Ghaziabad site.</p>\n\n<h2>FAQs</h2>\n<br>\n<h3>What container office sizes can I buy in Ghaziabad?</h3>\n<p>We supply 10ft, 20ft and 40ft container offices and customise the layout — from a compact security or sales cabin to a larger multi-room office.</p>\n<br>\n<h3>How long does delivery to Ghaziabad take?</h3>\n<p>Units are factory-built and typically reach Ghaziabad and NCR sites within a 3–5 day transit window once the order and layout are confirmed. Delivery starts from ₹3,000.</p>\n<br>\n<h3>Can a container office be used as a security cabin or sales counter?</h3>\n<p>Yes. The 10ft and 20ft units are commonly fitted out as security posts, sales kiosks or site offices, with doors, windows, lighting and power points to your plan.</p>\n<br>\n<h3>What warranty is included?</h3>\n<p>5 years on the structural frame and base, 1–2 years on finishing, and a 20–25 year engineered service life (the engineered life of the structure, not a warranty period).</p>\n<br>\n<h3>Do you supply new or second-hand units?</h3>\n<p>New only — manufactured on an MS steel frame to IS 2062. We do not supply used or refurbished containers.</p>\n<br>\n<h3>How do I get a price for Ghaziabad?</h3>\n<p>Call +91 62009 09435 or use Send Enquiry with your size, layout and location, and we will quote against your requirement.</p>",
    "protected": false
  },
  "excerpt": {
    "rendered": "<p>Discover modular container offices in Ghaziabad for schools, sales teams, and security units. SAMAN Portable offers customized solutions with quick setup in Indirapuram, Raj Nagar, and beyond.</p>\n",
    "protected": false
  },
